	(text "20x20 mm\n0.25mm trace w/ 0.25mm space\n9 windings\ntotal length 566.5mm excl track thickness\n\nL = ~2150 nH\nR = ~2.1 Ω\nRp assumed 15kΩ\nQ = ~80\nC = ~1.5pF\nF_res = ~90Mhz\n\nTarget Z 20Ω\nTarget Q 20\n\nusing varicap LXRW0YV600-054 (0-3V -> 60-30pF; 1.5V -> 45pF)\nC88/89 (Cs) -> 22pF\n\nC86/87 (C4/C8) -> 110pF\nC90/91 (Cp) -> 10pF\n\nC84/85 (Cemc) -> 680pF\nL6/7 (Lemc) -> 270nH, 500mΩ\n\nC81/82 -> 10pF\nC80/83 -> 110pF\n\nR4/R6 -> 3Ω"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
